# Canva Connect OAuth app credentials from the Developer Portal
# (Your apps → Outside Canva → Configuration).
# Docs: https://www.canva.dev/docs/connect/authentication/
# v1 lefthookhq/canva--frigg used CANVA_CONNECT_*; both names are accepted.
CANVA_CLIENT_ID=OC-your-client-id
CANVA_CLIENT_SECRET=cnvca_your_client_secret
# CANVA_CONNECT_CLIENT_ID=
# CANVA_CONNECT_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Space-separated scopes. Must already be enabled on the app.
# Explicit scopes are required (asset:write does NOT imply asset:read).
# Docs: https://www.canva.dev/docs/connect/appendix/scopes/
# Note: v1 tests used design:read / design:permissions:* — those are NOT in the
# current official scope list; use design:meta:read / design:content:* instead.
CANVA_SCOPE=openid profile email profile:read design:meta:read design:content:read design:content:write folder:read folder:write asset:read asset:write comment:read comment:write brandtemplate:meta:read collaboration:event
# CANVA_CONNECT_SCOPE=

# Shared Frigg redirect base; module appends /canva
REDIRECT_URI=https://your-app.example.com/redirect
